The prototype uses a configurable temperature threshold:

THRESHOLD = 30°C
Normal Condition

If:

Temperature < 30°C

The system operates in normal mode:

Green LED → ON/Blinking
Red LED   → OFF
Thermal Anomaly

If:

Temperature ≥ 30°C

The system enters alert mode:

Green LED → OFF
Red LED   → Blinking

The relay is controlled according to the programmed alert logic.
